Purani repo se specially kya preserve karna chahiye?

बहुत महत्वपूर्ण 6 चीजें:

knowledge/ontology → company/AI concepts ka common model

knowledge/packs → verified knowledge packages

knowledge/reconciliation → source reconciliation system

knowledge/source-map → provenance/source tracking

knowledge/agent-bindings → kaunsi knowledge kis agent ko milegi

knowledge/registry → knowledge registry


Ye cheezein purani repo mein already exist karti hain, isliye inhe dobara invent karna bilkul galat hoga.

Aur agents side par bhi purani repo mein account-intelligence, lead-intelligence, reply-intelligence, e2e-revenue, marketing, operations, outreach, sales jaise specialized components already hain.

Toh mera next step: purani repo ko systematically scan karke ek KEEP / ADAPT / MERGE / ARCHIVE / DON'T COPY inventory banaunga. Uske baad hi new repo mein files move karenge. Isse koi valuable cheez miss bhi nahi hogi aur new repo purani repo ki copy bhi nahi banega.